    <title>85. “脆皮年轻人”的健康饮食指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683e0eed31215eb506f93cdf</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">683e0eed31215eb506f93cdf</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 03 Jun 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当代的“脆皮年轻人”，年纪轻轻便有了自己的“慢病”：脱发、鼻炎、爆痘、溃疡、胃炎、便秘、腰突、失眠……靠外卖和保健品续命；一边熬夜，一边护肝；想健康饮食，却总在“假养生”里打转。</span></p><span></span><p><span>癌症年轻化不是吓唬人，真正的健康也不是靠一瓶复合维生素解决。</span><br><span></span><br><span>本期聊聊：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>癌症为什么年轻化？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>年轻人为什么热衷养生？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>保健品真能防病抗老？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>到底该怎么“好好吃饭”？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>帮你在吃得开心的同时，活得更久一点。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTsTeB96HHX0m0iMOkj4l2h-NGD.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>本期主播</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>十七</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【</span><strong><span>收听指南</span></strong><span>】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 癌症离年轻人并不遥远：演员朱媛媛、摄影师黄冰玲因癌离世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">01:35</a> 为什么癌症年轻化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> “脆皮”年轻人的健康焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 保健品依赖与迷思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="412">06:52</a> &nbsp;致命饮食误区</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 科学饮食三原则</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>吃全食（Whole Foods）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>弃补剂，优先食补</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>极简法则：多样化食材 + 少精加工 + 享受进食过程</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>【参考资料】</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>柯林·坎贝尔，《救命饮食：中国健康调查报告》&amp;《救命饮食：全营养与全健康从哪里来》</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Vitamania: The Sense and Nonsense of Vitamins（纪录片《维生素狂热》）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Institute for Health Metrics and Evaluation (IHME).</span><strong><span> Global Burden of Disease 2021: Findings from the GBD 2021 Study. </span></strong><span>Seattle, WA: IHME, 2024.</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>GBD 2017 Diet Collaborators. </span><strong><span>Health effects of dietary risks in 195 countries, 1990–2017: a systematic analysis for the Global Burden of Disease Study 2017</span></strong><span>. </span><em><span>The Lancet</span></em><span>. 2 April 2019. doi: 10.1016/S0140-6736(19)30041-8.</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>郑荣寿, 陈茹, 韩冰峰, 等. &nbsp;2022年中国恶性肿瘤流行情况分析 [J] . 中华肿瘤杂志, 2024, 46(3) : 221-231. DOI: 10.3760/cma.j.cn112152-20240119-00035.</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>Ledford, H. (2024). Why are so many young people getting cancer? What the data say. </span><em><span>Nature</span></em><span>, </span><em><span>627</span></em><span>(8003), 258–260. </span><a href="https://doi.org/10.1038/d41586-024-00720-6" data-url="https://doi.org/10.1038/d41586-024-00720-6"><span>doi.org</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>《那些天天吃营养补剂的年轻人，都怎么样了？》</span><a href="https://dxy.com/article/186013" data-url="https://dxy.com/article/186013"><span>dxy.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>中国保健品行业发展现状研究与投资前景分析报告（2025-2032年）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>《2024年中国膳食营养补充剂行业市场深度分析及投资战略咨询报告》</span><a href="https://xueqiu.com/1973934190/274814292?md5__1038=110279f682e-S9C9QDwoaDLoaBLDoaSaykGkCss9XmXv%2FHamDGGDjXtDY%2FkNH%2FGvPW4zKaYefEYJadl0a7kaBJCa%2Bx3apkwBaZWQc8aYkYBabkXRaxbaLpaccoLzaECaFadykJa49aJBa4Qyi5g23%2FaXaaPazGPa%3DhySnv76JY4mZ%2Fz74YkWZcxCEksoRXP9Ywa" data-url="https://xueqiu.com/1973934190/274814292?md5__1038=110279f682e-S9C9QDwoaDLoaBLDoaSaykGkCss9XmXv%2FHamDGGDjXtDY%2FkNH%2FGvPW4zKaYefEYJadl0a7kaBJCa%2Bx3apkwBaZWQc8aYkYBabkXRaxbaLpaccoLzaECaFadykJa49aJBa4Qyi5g23%2FaXaaPazGPa%3DhySnv76JY4mZ%2Fz74YkWZcxCEksoRXP9Ywa"><span>xueqiu.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>《2023年中国膳食营养补充剂(VDS)行业现状及竞争格局分析，市场将进一步细分和个性化》</span><a href="https://www.huaon.com/channel/trend/955029.html" data-url="https://www.huaon.com/channel/trend/955029.html"><span>www.huaon.com</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><span>《全球营养膳食补充剂市场研究报告》</span><a href="https://www.wiseguyreports.com/cn/reports/nutrition-dietary-supplements-market" data-url="https://www.wiseguyreports.com/cn/reports/nutrition-dietary-supplements-market"><span>www.wiseguyreports.com</span></a></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
